issues=[
{'page':1063,'issue':'784 inputs to 100 biased dense units gives 78,500 parameters, not over a million. Flattening retains values while changing spatial inductive bias. CNN is an ANN subtype; overfitting is not guaranteed by count alone.'},
{'page':1065,'issue':'The RPN belongs to Faster R-CNN, not Fast R-CNN; selected historical milestones do not establish first-ever invention. YOLOv1 preprint appeared in 2015, conference in 2016.'},
{'page':1066,'issue':'W,H,C is not a universal API axis order, and vision/CNN superiority claims are task-dependent.'},
{'page':1067,'issue':'The plus-offset formula is cross-correlation under mathematical convention, commonly called convolution in neural-network APIs. Padding preserves size only with suitable stride/kernel/dilation settings.'},
{'page':1069,'issue':'Fixed average pooling is linear; max pooling is not. Neither introduces trainable weights in the stated standard form.'},
{'page':1070,'issue':'Sigmoid can support independent multilabel outputs; softmax fits a mutually exclusive class distribution.'},
{'page':1072,'issue':'Displayed scores are not dataset accuracy or measured IoU; box encodings require an explicit position convention.'},
{'page':1075,'issue':'Original YOLOv1 coordinate, confidence and per-cell class-vector conventions are not interchangeable with later YOLO versions.'},
{'page':1076,'issue':'NMS is not one global winner; class policy, overlap and threshold determine suppression. 98 candidates do not imply 98 true objects.'},
{'page':1077,'issue':'Malformed class legend text remains a transcription limitation, not invented taxonomy.'},
{'page':1079,'issue':'A selected version table does not prove universal performance ranking or exhaust all versions/authors; batch normalization is not hard clipping.'},
{'page':1080,'issue':'Anchor-free removes predefined box shapes, not spatial reference points; actual box decoding includes extent, not only a center.'},
{'page':1081,'issue':'The reproduced four-branch figure is not the standard three-scale P3/P4/P5 YOLOv8 detection configuration.'},
{'page':1082,'issue':'Semantic features do not imply masks, and YOLOv1 objectness×IoU should not be imposed on the different YOLOv8 head.'},
{'page':1083,'issue':'Code is an inference excerpt, not training; uncached weights and URL input require network. Additional reporting code is needed for the shown formatted box list.'},
{'page':1084,'issue':'Printed scores/coordinates are rounded observations from an unpinned run; reproduced output does not establish detection truth or general accuracy.'}]
